# Build context for every image is the repo root (see apps/*/Dockerfile and infra/cdk).
# Dependencies and build output are recreated inside the image, never copied from the host.
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/dist
**/.turbo
**/coverage
**/cdk.out
# Local runtime state: never ship data, signing keys, mail, or screenshots
**/.data
**/.keys
**/.outbox
**/.screens
**/*.log
.git
.github
.env
.env.*
infra/cdk/test
